But you should know that sudden. serious
brain injury causes the victim to bite down hard.

648
00:43:50.520 --> 00:43:52.939
In fact. I hear the bite reflex is so strong.

649
00:43:53.022 --> 00:43:57.818
they have to pry the victim's jaws open...
with a crowbar.

650
00:44:00.655 --> 00:44:02.281
Where did you get this shit?

651
00:44:02.365 --> 00:44:04.033
I read it.

652
00:44:05.117 --> 00:44:07.995
Know how to read. you ignorant fuck?

653
00:44:09.497 --> 00:44:11.374
Honey...

654
00:44:12.625 --> 00:44:15.002
..you shouldn't.

655
00:44:15.086 --> 00:44:16.963
(GROANS)

656
00:44:17.046 --> 00:44:20.049
<i>RED: Bogs didn't put anything in Andy's mouth...</i>

657
00:44:20.132 --> 00:44:22.510
<i>and neither did his friends.</i>

658
00:44:22.593 --> 00:44:25.889
<i>What they did do...
is beat him within an inch of his life.</i>

659
00:44:27.099 --> 00:44:29.101
<i>Andy spent a month in the infirmary.</i>

660
00:44:30.185 --> 00:44:32.688
<i>Bogs spent a week in the hole.</i>

661
00:44:37.150 --> 00:44:38.777
Time's up. Bogs.

662
00:44:42.447 --> 00:44:44.533
It's your world. boss.

663
00:44:46.618 --> 00:44:50.038
TANNOY:
Return to your cell blocks for evening count.

664
00:44:50.122 --> 00:44:52.291
All prisoners report for lockdown.

665
00:45:07.849 --> 00:45:09.142
