669
00:45:25.950 --> 00:45:28.453
No! No!

670
00:45:28.536 --> 00:45:29.912
No!

671
00:45:29.996 --> 00:45:31.331
Help me...

672
00:45:31.414 --> 00:45:32.707
Aaarghh!

673
00:45:32.790 --> 00:45:34.917
